WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
NARRATOR: The doors open at seven.

00:04.000 --> 00:05.500
[Soft bell rings]

00:06.000 --> 00:10.500
MAYA: Use the east entrance after sunset.

00:11.000 --> 00:15.500
NARRATOR: Staff can provide a portable ramp.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
[Footsteps move from left to right]

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
MAYA: Ask at the lantern desk if you need assistance.
